Z||000000||MikeSchaefer||03-07-2001||08:15 PM||||Ok, here is a nice list of cars with scoops that are used on Fieros by many listees.  It should help you while traveling through the yards.<BR><B><BR>94 Grand Prix SE<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/94grandprixse3.jpg">    <BR>88 Sunbird GT<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88sunbirdGT.jpg">    <BR>79 Firebird/Trans Am<BR>turn this around and you have a wonderful side intake<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/79transamfirebirdd.jpg">    <BR>66 Mustang Fastback<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/files/louver3.jpg">    <BR>79 Mustang<BR>Turn this around and it mounts on the decklid beautifully<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://mpmotorsports.net/images/79HoodScoop.JPG">      <BR>fieroshop.net's new scoops<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fieroshop.net/images/hood2.jpg">    <BR></B><BR>Well I've probably wasted enough bandwidth on my own now, if you know other scoops put the pics up here.  We need to gather information on things like this into one topic for future reference.<BR>Peace,<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A><BR><p>[This message has been edited by MikeSchaefer (edited 03-07-2001).]||||reg||6
