Z||000007||286SE'S||03-08-2001||04:22 PM||||Don't forget to get the headlight motors and controller from the 88 sunbird!<BR>I have an X1/9 in my yard! hasn't started for 3 years. Those scoops are functional!<BR>Drivers side is the air intake to filter, passenger side has a long foil tupe that goes up over the engine and into the back of the alternator to cool the diodes. ||||reg||1
