Z||000023||rockcrawl||03-14-2001||05:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>What's an estimate on the time and labor$$ for that job?<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>That's the original one I made which took about 8-12 hours. I made a mold of it so I can make as many as I want with much less effort, just cut a hole and drop it in on a bead of SMC adhesive, finish the edges with bondo and you're done. See my site for more info <A HREF="http://www.fortunecity.com/silverstone/impala/403/fieroparts.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fortunecity.com/silverstone/impala/403/fieroparts.htm</A> <P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000024||DXR_DAD||03-14-2001||07:26 PM||||Thanks Jon,<P>P.S. I do like your style!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>DXR_DAD||||reg||12
